riginalCharacterName":"ユーリ=ミモリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuuri is a beginner just assigned to the LWC. He has a fair and somewhat feminine appearance, and his manner is soft and gentle. He is ill with a strange illness that causes his body to slowly deteriorate if he does not take medicine for it regularly. Since joining the LWC, he has been plagued by a strange recurring dream."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5055"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/0150881d2b0e5c39a08856dacf6ca6afc7eb25220dd1ae9f989c7a832790eee5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21b89d861e832f1e82fc694df796f45940e29a410a289b3958ee6f77a75d5fa4.webp","width":169,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"プログレス","creatorId":"vndb:s400","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s400","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s400","name":"千葉進歩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12607","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5056","characterName":"イブキ=タカムラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5056"},"originalCharacterName":"イブキ=タカムラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ibuki is also a beginner to the LWC who joined with Yuuri, his childhood friend. He is a very likable person that gives off a very invigorating impression. He likes to stay close to Yuuri because he is extremely worried about his bad health."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5056"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9ebabbb839ed1b3c4809c6308879d4947e6ab4db391724d421faefdc4bfc8aa9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/6727f42225f896b08cfe2dc0c8a8f62d4d73a11256daa16463130f779a5490c2.webp","width":163,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瀧川 大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s90","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s90","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s90","name":"鈴村 健一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12608","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5057","characterName":"ロイ=カシザキ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5057"},"originalCharacterName":"ロイ=カシザキ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roy is the leader of the LWC. He is very serious and lives only for his work. He likes to harass his subordinates diligently on a daily basis, but Yuuri and Ibuki seem to bring about a secret inner softness within him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5057"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/1751876959b25a01298c3bbd713b0d3cb294fdc350b76e6925bfa367ead9bfd5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c4252f4f120ad5cda8726316b1a2428c29945b66af4b84bfc2971ba2089f1ca0.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浜五郎","creatorId":"vndb:s743","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s743","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s743","name":"小杉 十郎太","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12610","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5058","characterName":"ジェイル=コガ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5058"},"originalCharacterName":"ジェイル=コガ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Jeiru is a member of the LWC, and an expert gunsman. He is a loose person who likes to spend all his wages on gambling and alcohol, then ends up having to ask for his paycheck in advance, which causes him to get preached at by Roy. He immediately quickly aims for the newcomer Yuuri."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5058"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92467bcff6284c22301fa895f9740d4c7414defeacaec244f879efeec141e50a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da1638b4c2fb4b497af770ae68ae8573a5988c0e50b68e15a9485931e6678d4b.webp","width":176,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小西 克幸","creatorId":"vndb:s65","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s65","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s65","name":"小西 克幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12604","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5059","characterName":"リオン=クニサダ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5059"},"originalCharacterName":"リオン=クニサダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rion is a member of the LWC. He is the son of the boss of the LWC, Sein, and lost his mother when he was young, causing him to be awkward with his father since then. He has a very intense personality with high pride. After Yuuri arrives, he takes an interest in him despite the fact that numerous people already like him for his graceful looks. Because he is so stubborn, he is constantly butting heads with Roy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5059"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/6671ca6f85b850708de817ed03bad2d2d1d0e61e7c799ec7127589b3b5d72c7b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db9f925aedcbe70f87efac72fcc6031ef09be04e4a431c26659bf6695cafbe8b.webp","width":160,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩永 哲哉","creatorId":"vndb:s1088","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1088","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1088","name":"岩永 哲哉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12611","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5060","characterName":"マオ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5060"},"originalCharacterName":"マオ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mao is an outcast of society, being part human with animal ears and a tail. He is discovered by the LWC when he causes a commotion in town, and they take him under their care. Originally not speaking the language of the humans, Mao learns quickly though speaks very slowly and broken. He has a very innocent personality, and a huge appetite that causes him to try to eat just about anything."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5060"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b08ed454433ca9a48e07e24ffbfc2786028188f4deebbd005f88801a6f07d16.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d75020d576eaffd4a9296f42113c89a4aba1947e5b4121f5c5b978d6d7a7764.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"宮田 幸季","creatorId":"vndb:s387","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s387","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s387","name":"宮田 幸季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12606","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5061","characterName":"ツカサ=シノノメ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5061"},"originalCharacterName":"ツカサ=シノノメ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsukasa deals with the medical affairs and counseling of the policeman in the LWC. He is a very gentle person and good at healing. He loves psychology and seems to enjoy creating his own psychological tests in his spare time."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5061"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/eccd653bac762b57ee9575bb5eac06f5fd61198d73b17f2e456ba05b6e3cf94e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9897005d31fe22342e58965c738d4469e2d604492cd016cfbd931a2f994d1da.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"津久井 教生","creatorId":"vndb:s1445","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1445","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1445","name":"津久井 教生","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12613","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5062","characterName":"ブラッド=ヒルマ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5062"},"originalCharacterName":"ブラッド=ヒルマ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Brad is the director and a doctor in a hospital known for its use of lots of equipment and low fees, making it very popular among the citizens. Though polite, he gives off a very cold impression and an atmosphere that makes people want to keep their distance from him. He used to be a cheerful person with lots of friends in the past, but now he has a very closed off personality."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5062"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92b4078dfa449136724b76e00e85814d8c5e36433757528c1ae275a33c1d9c29.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2ae24f832f8d63918cb61349f9d6ad075910a6556e98aef2b4fb97e177a0a772.webp","width":157,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤木 達哉","creatorId":"vndb:s1443","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1443","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1443","name":"うえだ ゆうじ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12612","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5063","characterName":"ラグシエル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5063"},"originalCharacterName":"ラグシエル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ragsiel is a god that has had a constant battle with a demon, Herdeus. He seems to have a mysterious link with Yuuri, who ends up in the middle of this ancient war between the two forces..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5063"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61a139af59e29b535a788da3ff1edaf7446c18949c1df7e9e028c1bfd97d0772.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c6bb36898b62920ca07650854f12ef73d6645e6a13e04941cb6e0cdfcc1a7d0.webp","width":175,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"紫花 薫","creatorId":"vndb:s374","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s374","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s374","name":"井上 和彦","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12605","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5064","characterName":"フィリオ=オサカベ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5064"},"originalCharacterName":"フィリオ=オサカベ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Firio is a member of the LWC. He has a very timid and hesitant personality, and is always being made fun of by the other members. However, when he has a gun in his hand or behind the steering wheel in a car, his personality completely changes. He has a love for machines."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5064"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c64670a365b6bf356f937045925f61bf0416c91f23fc81c6c989d865b279802.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75881f2b39b917d0a8ec35c69163fdc06ab076226106ca6e98bae04f8588573c.webp","width":145,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"坂ノ上 秀麻呂","creatorId":"vndb:s89","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s89","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s89","name":"伊藤健太郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:12609","source":"vndb"}]},{"